        "Require": "1.Upright, humble, diligent with high moral values.\r\n诚信正直、低调谦逊、艰苦奋斗，具备良好的道德品质。\r\n2.This program is open to domestic and overseas graduates, master's degree or above is required.\r\n境内外高校应届毕业生，硕士研究生及以上学历。\r\n3.Including but not limited to financial, economics, mathematics, management, accounting and other majors.\r\n包括但不限于金融，经济，数学，管理，会计等专业。\r\n4.Excellent academic achievement.\r\n具有卓越的学术成绩。\r\n5.Bilingual proficiency in English and Mandarin.\r\n精通英语与汉语普通话。\r\n6.Strong passion for different functions in fixed income, commodities and currency field.\r\n对从事固定收益相关工作有强烈的意愿。",
